{"name": "Cosmic Arcade Tycoon", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your dream arcade at your own pace.</strong> No pressure, no deadlines, just a cozy space to fill with games, decorations, warm neon lights and a bite-sized playthrough duration.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your arcade from the ground up, shaping its layout while choosing from a handful of structures, furniture, decoration and arcade machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"231\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426730/extras/8c5e2689d04b266b64c7353b98eb4708.poster.avif?t=1773957628\" width=\"540\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426730/extras/8c5e2689d04b266b64c7353b98eb4708.webm?t=1773957628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unlock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your Computer to unlock new objects, expand your land and customize your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"231\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426730/extras/acde073b578811f0983af8edd3c7ef5a.poster.avif?t=1773957628\" width=\"540\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426730/extras/acde073b578811f0983af8edd3c7ef5a.webm?t=1773957628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enjoy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite charming, randomly generated alien guests and watch them spend time in your creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"231\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426730/extras/6845defeb776d46faa5007136743bda3.poster.avif?t=1773957628\" width=\"540\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426730/extras/6845defeb776d46faa5007136743bda3.webm?t=1773957628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Are you ready to bring your dream arcade to life?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Discord, get in touch with the community, speak to the developers and share your layouts!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A cozy sci-fi arcade sim where you build, customize, unlock, expand and welcome cute alien visitors!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426730/dcf084e018467c5c0e2efc02e814727554022ca3/header.jpg?t=1773957628", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Casual", "Simulation", "Cozy", "Space", "Cute", "Singleplayer"], "developers": "NebulaNookGames", "publishers": "NebulaNookGames", "release_date": "Mar 6, 2025", "price": "$2.49", "appid": "3426730", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "15 February 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/XH6Qc9JWAhE", "first_seen": 1739577600.0, "review_rank": 1854}